cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this educational resource or its software, please cite the specific release you used."
title: "Linux, Git and Reproducible Workflows for Bioinformatics"
abstract: >-
  A beginner-level, CI-tested open course on the POSIX command line, version
  control and workflow management for the life sciences, taught with biological
  data. Includes the bioflow pipeline runner and sequence-QC toolkit, five-level
  assessments, and an instructor pack.
authors:
